+* every entry names its platform, the exact licence, and whether a credit line is required;
+* ``credit`` holds the line to paste into the YouTube description when attribution is required;
+* ``themes`` uses the tags ``engine/audio/music_library.py`` understands, so an imported track is picked for
+  the right videos automatically;
+* ``search`` is what to type on the platform, so the list still works if a direct link changes.
